  "body": "Did you say SUNNY? Then you'll want to see this one.\r\n\r\nElevated to capture beautiful sea views and filled with natural light, this warm and welcoming freehold property offers an exciting combination of family living, lifestyle and future potential.\r\n\r\nWhether you're looking for a place to call home, an investment to add to your portfolio or a property with development potential, there's plenty here to get excited about.\r\n\r\nFeaturing four generous bedrooms, two bathrooms plus a guest toilet, there's ample space for the whole family to spread out and enjoy. The excellent connection between the living spaces and outdoors makes everyday living and entertaining effortless. Open the doors, let the sunshine in and enjoy a home that feels comfortable, practical and wonderfully easy to live in.\r\n\r\nProperty highlights:\r\n- Elevated position capturing beautiful sea views\r\n- Sunny, light-filled interiors\r\n- Freehold property with future potential\r\n- Four generous bedrooms\r\n- Two bathrooms plus guest toilet\r\n- Excellent indoor-outdoor flow\r\n- Garden and outdoor spaces for the whole family\r\n- Potential development opportunity (subject to council approval)\r\n- Sought-after school zones including Rangitoto College\r\n- Walk to the beach, local shops and nearby parks\r\n\r\nAnd then there's the location. With the beach, shops and parks all within easy reach, plus excellent schooling nearby, this is a property that offers plenty of lifestyle appeal today, with potential for tomorrow.\r\n\r\nWhether it's morning coffees in the sunshine, children enjoying the garden, relaxed family dinners or weekends at the beach, this is a home designed around the way families really live. For investors and builders, the opportunity to explore the property's future potential adds another exciting dimension. Please see the digitally enhanced images to show the future potential.\r\n\r\nOur sellers are ready for their next chapter, creating an opportunity for the next family, savvy investor or astute developer to make their move.\r\n\r\nCome and see it for yourself - you may just know when you walk through the door.",
